# UI language

The product UI is **English only** for now (labels, buttons, hints, aria-labels, user-facing notices).

- Do not add new Russian (or other) UI strings in `apps/web` or in core helpers that feed the SPA (`hostLayoutChoiceLabel`, reserved profile names, etc.).
- When touching a screen that still has leftover non-English copy, rename those strings to English in the same change when practical.
- Fixtures, xkb source comments, and tests that assert glyph content (Cyrillic letters on keycaps) are fine; user-visible chrome is not.
